CLASS:PUBLIC
DESCRIPTION:In Tzav (“Command”)\, God tells Moses about the sacrifices
  offered in the Tabernacle (portable sanctuary)\, including a meal offerin
 g brought by the high priest\, guilt offerings\, and offerings of thanks. 
 Moses initiates Aaron and Aaron’s sons for priestly service in the Taber
 nacle.\n\nTorah: Leviticus 6:1-8:36\nHaftarah: Malachi 3:4-24 | Shabbat Ha
 Gadol\n\nhttps://hebcal.com/s/5786/25?uc=ical-diaspora
END:VEVENT
